flowchart LR
    User[Attendee or Organizer] --> CF[CloudFront]
    CF --> S3[S3 React SPA]
    S3 --> Supabase[Supabase Auth Edge Functions Postgres]
    Supabase --> App[App Runner Worker]
    App --> ECR[ECR Image]
    Supabase -. notification adapter .-> SQS[SQS Queue]
    App -. optional SQS consumer .-> SQS
    CW[CloudWatch] -. metrics and logs .-> CF
    CW -. metrics and logs .-> App
    CW -. metrics and logs .-> SQS
